            "review_title": "Review at Bò tơ 2 Phệ",
            "review_text": "Rose towsley\n3 contributions\n0\nWe tried a lot!\nApr 2024 • Family\nThe food quality is mediocre at best and quite disappointing considering the price point. The beef lacks tenderness and flavor, making it a poor value for money. Overall, the dining experience leaves much to be desired.\n1. The chilled grilled beef ribs barely scrape a 1 on the rating scale.\n2. The beef wrapped in cabbage emits a faint soap-like aroma, also warranting a 1.\n3. However, the beef mixed with watercress receives a commendable 9.\n4. The grilled beef takes nearly 40 minutes to arrive, and the serving size is disappointingly small, consisting of just a handful of tiny pieces.\nWhile the pricing is reasonable and the food is passable, coupled with a convenient location and clean restroom facilities, the cramped parking space detracts from the overall experience. Despite its shortcomings, the food is undeniably delicious, eliciting great satisfaction from my family during our dining outing.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 12, 2024",
